# Build-context allowlist.
#
# Exclude everything, then re-include exactly what docker/Dockerfile.finn reads.
# A denylist would silently regrow: deps/ alone is 1.2 GB and .git 97 MB, and
# neither is used by the build - the image fetches its own pinned copies of the
# Python deps rather than consuming the host checkout.
#
# FINN's own src/ is deliberately absent. It is never baked: the image ships the
# dependency closure and console scripts, and $FINN_ROOT/src is resolved from the
# mounted workspace at import time (see docker/finn_paths.py).
*

!requirements.txt
!docker/
!deps.env
!fetch-repos.sh

# XRT and v80++ packages, staged into the repo root by run-docker.sh when a
# local copy is supplied instead of a download.
!*.deb
